      "exact_quote": "An <dfn variants=\"ECMAScript language types\" tabindex=\"-1\">ECMAScript language type</dfn>\n  corresponds to values that are directly manipulated by an ECMAScript\nprogrammer using the ECMAScript language. The ECMAScript language types\nare Undefined, Null, Boolean, String, Symbol, Number, BigInt, and\nObject. An <dfn variants=\"ECMAScript language values\" tabindex=\"-1\">ECMAScript language value</dfn> is a value that is characterized by an ECMAScript language type.",
